    "q_en": "An employee recently resigned from a company. The employee was responsible for managing and supporting\nweekly batch jobs over the past five years. A few weeks after the employee resigned. one of the batch jobs\ntalked and caused a major disruption. Which of the following would work best to prevent this type of incident\nfrom reoccurring?",
    "q_uz": "An employee recently resigned from a company. The employee was responsible for managing and supporting\nweekly batch jobs over the past five years. A few weeks after the employee resigned. one of the batch jobs\ntalked and caused a major disruption. Which of the following would work best to prevent this type of incident\nfrom reoccurring?",
